OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for five years for
OL,4,Asexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who subjected a woman in York to
OL,7,Fwhat police have described as a
OL,8,F"terrifying and traumatic" sexual
OL,9,Fassault has been jailed for five years.
OL,11,FMatthew Banks, 40, of Wheldrake, near
OL,12,FYork, admitted sexual assault by
OL,13,Fpenetration and sexual assault by
OL,14,Ftouching and was sentenced at York
OL,15,FCrown Court on Friday.
OL,17,FThe attack took place in the early
OL,18,Fhours of 25 July 2021 while Banks was
OL,19,Fat the woman's home, according to North
OL,20,FYorkshire Police.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
