OL,4,Asexual assault
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe victim, who later escaped and
OL,7,Fsought help from neighbours, told the
OL,8,Fcourt the assault had affected "almost
OL,9,Fevery aspect of my life" and that it
OL,10,Fwould take "a long time" to fully heal.
